  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Fleet Vehicle Source is a federal vendor with $447M in contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Fleet Vehicle Source received 14,915 awards in the current fiscal-year-to-date period, with an average award size of $30K. Fleet Vehicle Source obligations are up 14.3% year over year. Fiscal-year obligations show a multi-year pattern: FY21 was $182M, FY22 was $232M, FY23 was $474M, FY24 was $256M, FY25 was $391M, and FY26 is $447M. Fleet Vehicle Source obligations peaked in FY23 at $474M and remain above earlier-year levels in FY25 and FY26. Fleet Vehicle Source totals are contract obligations, while some tables list award-value figures as total contract values. Fleet Vehicle Source current-year totals are partial because they reflect fiscal year to date. Fleet Vehicle Source activity reflects many small awards alongside larger awards, as indicated by the 14,915 award count and the $30K average award size. Fleet Vehicle Source obligations and award counts are useful for contractors tracking procurement scale and sourcing opportunities in fleet-related federal buying.",
